{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794527381449,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd83c38ffe6oPXPzjHJBVHzf","part":{"partID":"prt_1d22ab392001o0Rrp3O4sahJV2","sessionID":"ses_e2dd83c38ffe6oPXPzjHJBVHzf","messageID":"msg_1d22aaa2f0012cGfYxrkEhLUKv","type":"tool","id":"call_3324e5b219504dbe94793dfd","tool":"write","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"# Socket key: how the daemon socket name is derived\n\n## .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts (ADV)\n\n- `DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR = '/tmp/system-skill-advisor'` at line 30.\n- `ensureSocketEnvironment()` at line 1088 sets `process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` when it is unset (line 1090). It is called from the tool runner at line 1359.\n- `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` at line 1362 derives the socket path, through the checkout's own bridge loaded by `loadBridge()` at line 245.\n- `paths.dbDir` is `<checkout>/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database` (line 228), unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs (LCH)\n\n- `createChildEnv()` at line 312 derives the daemon socket dir at line 336: `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir(), env: sourceEnv })`.\n- `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` at line 1058 calls `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir() })` at line 1060.\n- `resolvedAdvisorDbDir()` at line 383 resolves to the checkout's `runtime/database`, unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\n\n## .skilled/bin/lib/launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs (shared derivation both call)\n\n- `resolveIpcSocketDir()` at line 139 and `getIpcSocketPath()` at line 162 joins `daemon-ipc.sock`.\n- `shouldScopeIpcSocket()` at line 103 returns true for `system-skill-advisor` when the socket dir resolves to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, or when `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`.\n- When scoped, line 152 hashes the canonical database directory with `sha256(dbDir).slice(0, 12)`, and line 153 joins that digest under the socket dir.\n- When the derived path exceeds the sun_path limit, `withinLimitOrRelocated()` at line 157 relocates it to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor/<sha256(intended dir).slice(0, 12)>`, still keyed by the intended directory.\n\n## Two checkouts\n\nThe scoped digest is taken over the checkout's own database directory, so two checkouts derive two different socket directories and start two daemons. An explicit `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` other than the default skips that database scope unless `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`, so every checkout pointed at that same directory would share one daemon.\n\nper-checkout\n","path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/socket-key.txt"},"output":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/socket-key.txt","title":"write","metadata":{"metadata":{"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Created file successfully: specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/socket-key.txt"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"content\":\"# Socket key: how the daemon socket name is derived\\n\\n## .skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/skill-advisor-cli.ts (ADV)\\n\\n- `DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR = '/tmp/system-skill-advisor'` at line 30.\\n- `ensureSocketEnvironment()` at line 1088 sets `process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` when it is unset (line 1090). It is called from the tool runner at line 1359.\\n- `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` at line 1362 derives the socket path, through the checkout's own bridge loaded by `loadBridge()` at line 245.\\n- `paths.dbDir` is `<checkout>/.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/database` (line 228), unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\\n\\n## .skilled/bin/system-skill-advisor-launcher.cjs (LCH)\\n\\n- `createChildEnv()` at line 312 derives the daemon socket dir at line 336: `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir(), env: sourceEnv })`.\\n- `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` at line 1058 calls `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir() })` at line 1060.\\n- `resolvedAdvisorDbDir()` at line 383 resolves to the checkout's `runtime/database`, unless `SYSTEM_SKILL_ADVISOR_DB_DIR` overrides it.\\n\\n## .skilled/bin/lib/launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs (shared derivation both call)\\n\\n- `resolveIpcSocketDir()` at line 139 and `getIpcSocketPath()` at line 162 joins `daemon-ipc.sock`.\\n- `shouldScopeIpcSocket()` at line 103 returns true for `system-skill-advisor` when the socket dir resolves to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor`, or when `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`.\\n- When scoped, line 152 hashes the canonical database directory with `sha256(dbDir).slice(0, 12)`, and line 153 joins that digest under the socket dir.\\n- When the derived path exceeds the sun_path limit, `withinLimitOrRelocated()` at line 157 relocates it to `/tmp/system-skill-advisor/<sha256(intended dir).slice(0, 12)>`, still keyed by the intended directory.\\n\\n## Two checkouts\\n\\nThe scoped digest is taken over the checkout's own database directory, so two checkouts derive two different socket directories and start two daemons. An explicit `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` other than the default skips that database scope unless `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_SCOPE=database`, so every checkout pointed at that same directory would share one daemon.\\n\\nper-checkout\\n\",\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/socket-key.txt\"}"},"time":{"start":1794527376274,"end":1794527381449}}}}
