{"type":"text","timestamp":1794527438968,"sessionID":"ses_e2dd83c38ffe6oPXPzjHJBVHzf","part":{"id":"prt_1d22b94de00273SJmW5yX4YTdI","sessionID":"ses_e2dd83c38ffe6oPXPzjHJBVHzf","messageID":"msg_1d22b7ec4001Fy4ja4SaVgXckW","type":"text","text":"T002 complete. Report:\n\n**File written**\n- `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/010-reachability-and-attribution/scratch/socket-key.txt`\n\n**What it records**\n- `ADV/skill-advisor-cli.ts`: `DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` (line 31), `ensureSocketEnvironment()` (line 1089, sets `SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR` at 1091), `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` (line 1363), per-checkout `dbDir` (line 229).\n- `LCH`: `createChildEnv()` (line 312) assigning `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir(...)` (line 336), `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` (line 1058 → line 1060).\n- The shared bridge derivation in `.skilled/bin/lib/launcher-ipc-bridge.cjs`: `resolveIpcSocketDir()` (line 139), `getIpcSocketPath()` (line 162), database-scope digest (line 152) and join (line 153).\n- Conclusion: the scoped digest is over each checkout's own database directory, so two checkouts derive two socket dirs and reach two daemons.\n- Last line is the single word `per-checkout`.\n\n**Verify output**\n```\nlast-line: per-checkout\n6:- `ensureSocketEnvironment()` at line 1089 sets `process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR` when it is unset (line 1091). It is called from the tool runner at line 1360.\n7:- `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir })` at line 1363 derives the socket path, through the checkout's own bridge loaded by `loadBridge()` at line 244.\n12:- `createChildEnv()` at line 312 derives the daemon socket dir at line 336: `filtered.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = bridge.resolveIpcSocketDir('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir(), env: sourceEnv })`.\n13:- `resolveSessionProxySocketPath()` at line 1058 calls `getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: resolvedAdvisorDbDir() })` at line 1060.\n18:- `resolveIpcSocketDir()` at line 139 and `getIpcSocketPath()` at line 162 joins `daemon-ipc.sock`.\nconst DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR = '/tmp/system-skill-advisor';\nfunction ensureSocketEnvironment(): void {\n    process.env.SPECKIT_IPC_SOCKET_DIR = DEFAULT_SOCKET_DIR;\n  ensureSocketEnvironment();\n  const socketPath = bridge.getIpcSocketPath('system-skill-advisor', { dbDir: paths.dbDir });\n```\n\n**Note**\n- `skill-advisor-cli.ts` shifted by one line between my first read and the write (another worker touched it). I re-read and recorded the current anchors, then re-verified each cited line printed the expected code.\n- Did not tick T002 in `tasks.md`. No other files touched.","time":{"start":1794527433950,"end":1794527438968}}}
